								Cardicor 5 mg 1 cpr ore 8
								Lasix 25 mg 2 cpr ore 8
								Peptazol 40 mg 1 cpr ore 8
								Arixtra 2.5 mg 1 fl s.c. ore 8
								Coumadin sec INR (range terapeutico 2-3)
							</text>
